data: {"type":"tool-output-available","toolCallId":"call-303e1ef2-38b1-4e94-9cbb-52831371cf70","output":{"output":"<repo>github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core</repo>\n<path>packages/framework/esm-framework/docs/functions/formatDate.md</path>\n<url>undefined</url>\n<content>\n1: [O3 Framework](../API.md) / formatDate\n2: \n3: # Function: formatDate()\n4: \n5: > **formatDate**(`date`, `options?`): `string`\n6: \n7: Defined in: [packages/framework/esm-utils/src/dates/date-util.ts:306](https://github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/blob/main/packages/framework/esm-utils/src/dates/date-util.ts#L306)\n8: \n9: Formats the input date according to the current locale and the\n10: given options.\n11: \n12: Default options:\n13:  - mode: \"standard\",\n14:  - time: \"for today\",\n15:  - day: true,\n16:  - month: true,\n17:  - year: true\n18:  - noToday: false\n19: \n20: If the date is today then \"Today\" is produced (in the locale language).\n21: This behavior can be disabled with `noToday: true`.\n22: \n23: When time is included, it is appended with a comma and a space. This\n24: agrees with the output of `Date.prototype.toLocaleString` for *most*\n25: locales.\n26: \n27: ## Parameters\n28: \n29: ### date\n30: \n31: `Date`\n32: \n33: The date to format.\n34: \n35: ### options?\n36: \n37: `Partial`\\<[`FormatDateOptions`](../type-aliases/FormatDateOptions.md)\\>\n38: \n39: Optional formatting options.\n40: \n41: ## Returns\n42: \n43: `string`\n44: \n45: The formatted date string.\n46: \n\n(End of file - 46 lines total)\n</content>","sources":[{"type":"file","repo":"github.com/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core","path":"packages/framework/esm-framework/docs/functions/formatDate.md","name":"formatDate.md","revision":"HEAD"}]}}

